00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.590
we're probably going
to do it on Discord.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.650
It's probably going to be
one chapter a month. And

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:48.970
it would be best for people
who are rereading, like we are.

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:51.580
A lot of people went
through ISLR in their past.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.010
They're already pretty familiar
with all of these statistical

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:58.360
concepts and they would like to
